    "chunk_text": "Mrs. Chamila Adhikari, after the death of her husband, the three-wheeler service station is being operated by employing a worker. (ii) According to the observations of the field inspection carried out on 16.01.2026, a letter dated 02.02.2026 had been sent to Mrs. Chamila Adhikari, the wife of the late G. Prasanna Jayasiri, informing her to implement the following recommendations within 21 days. The letter is given as Annex *.\n\n1577 1578\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 * \u0db4\u0dd4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0dba\u0dda \u0dad\u0db6\u0dcf \u0d87\u0dad.\u0dda \u0dad\u0db6\u0dcf \u0d87\u0dad. * \u0ba8\u0bc2\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bc8\u0baf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0bb5\u0bc8\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1.\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1. * Placed in the Library.\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0db8\u0dda\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0dc0\n\nRecommendations\n\n- Since the industrialist, Mr. G. Prasanna\n\nJayasiri, had passed way, the original copy of the Environmental Protection Licence bearing No. WE - C01249(R4) and dated 2025.05.23 issued to him by the Central Environmental Authority, together with a copy of the death certificate, should be submitted to the Central Environmental Authority.\n\n- The documents relating to the present\n\nownership of the service station should be submitted to the Central Environmental Authority.\n\n(iii) Irrelevant.\n\n(iv) \u2022 The complaint submitted by Mr. Ajith P.\n\nPerera, Attorney-at-Law, was received by the Kalutara District Office on 11.09.2025 through the Complaints Coordination Unit of the Head Office.\n\n\u2022 Accordingly, the complaint was inspected\n\non 28.10.2025 by the officers of the Kalutara District Office, and at that time the three-wheeler service station was closed.\n\n\u2022 The said industry was again inspected on\n\n26.11.2025, and on that occasion, the industry was in operation. However, the complainant party was not at home. Thereafter, the complainant telephoned the office and asked the officers, as he was not met, to visit again for a field inspection.\n\n\u2022 In accordance with that request, a field"
