    "md5": "5ff7ff4589f1f21a8bb0c042e363057d",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 906,
    "chunk_text": "Sri Lanka formally believes that diplomacy must prevail over confrontation. Madam, at the heart of these tensions lies a fundamental question about the international system itself, whether the world will continue to be guided by the international law and a rules-based order or whether the stability of regions and sea lanes will increasingly be shaped by confrontation and unilateral action. For countries such as Sri Lanka, the answer to that question is of vital importance.\n\n2023 2024\n\n\u0db4\u0dc4\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dd2\u0dda\u0db8\u0dca\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dc0\n\nfor the countries bordering the Indian Ocean, it is also essential for the stability of the global economy. Sri Lanka, therefore, calls upon all parties involved in regional tensions to exercise the utmost restraint and pursue dialogue and diplomatic engagement as the primary means of resolving disputes. Escalation of tension benefits no one; peace benefits everyone."
  },
