    "chunk_text": "[\u0db8\u0db1\u0dca \u0d85\u0db1\u0dd4\u0dbb \u0db1\u0dca\u0dab\u0ddc\u0dd2\u0db1\u0d9a \u0dab\u0dc4\u0dad\u0ddc]\n\nAnnex 02\n\n2026 \u0dab\u0ddc\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 19\n\n5. The total amount of Embarkation Levy currently outstanding and unpaid by each airline is given in Annex 03 below.\n\n7.\n\n8. The Terminal 2 Development Project of the\n\n9 Ampara Airport SLAF N/A\n\n10 Trincomalee/China Bay Airport SLAF N/A\n\n11 Anuradhapura Airport SLAF N/A\n\n12 Hingurakgoda Airport SLAF N/A\n\n13 Katukurunda Airport SLAF N/A\n\nName of the\n\nAirport\n\nDesigned Capacity (passenger)\n\nPer Year\n\nPassengers Handled in\n\n2025\n\nRate of Utilization\n\nBIA 7 Million 9.96 Million 142%\n\nMRIA 1 Million 122,856 12.28%\n\nJIA 0.2 Million 52,825 26.41%\n\nCIAR 0.2 Million 0 -\n\nBatticaloa Air-port (Domestic) 0.1 Million 1,737 1.74%\n\n2349 2350\n\n6. We have 13 international and domestic airports operational in Sri Lanka and the details are given below.\n\nName of the Airport Airport Operator\n\nAnnual Passenger\n\nHandling Capacity/\n\nDesigned Capacity\n\n1 Bandaranaike International Air-port, Katunayake (BIA) AASL 7 Million\n\n2 Mattala Rajapaksa International Airport (MRIA) AASL 1 Million\n\n3 Jaffna International Airport (JIA) AASL 0.2 Million\n\n4 Colombo International Airport Ratmalana (CIAR) AASL 0.2 Million\n\n5 Batticaloa Airport AASL 1 Million\n\n6 Sigiriya Airport SLAF N/A\n\n7 Koggala Airport SLAF N/A\n\n8 Weerawila Airport SLAF N/A\n\nAnnex 03\n\n\u0ddc\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0db8\u0db4\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0dc0\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dab\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bb0\u0bb5\u0bbf \u0b95\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) (The Hon. Ravi Karunanayake) Sir, I congratulate the Hon. Minister for giving a precise Answer and I appreciate it. I hope that all the other Ministers would take cue from the Minister.\n\nHon. Minister, in your response, which I was eagerly listening to, there was one specific elimination. The President cited the Hingurakgoda Airport as a way forward and that has not been brought into the Answer. I presume it is part of this with its constructions ongoing."
