    "md5": "d626ef103f10e7a41dcc85cac25e6e45",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2307,
    "chunk_text": "The next one is cargo. Last time, I told the Hon. Minister of Fisheries, Aquatic and Ocean Resources that about 400 to 500 tons of fish perish due to lack of capacity. So, ensure that these all these areas are converted so that we could earn foreign exchange at this fairly decisive time. So, Hon. Minister, you have a big role to play with regard to both the Port and the Airport. You can bring them into Sri Lanka by sea and take them out by air. So, all these can be converted, if you adopt a forward-thinking approach.\n\nAll we could basically do is give you ideas and those must be crystalized soon because this type of situation would not last for the next two, three or four years. So, seize the opportunity.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dab\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bb0\u0bb5\u0bbf \u0b95\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) (The Hon. Ravi Karunanayake) Hon. Speaker, this is also important. You allowed 15 minutes to answer a very good point relating to Question No. 9.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Speaker) Please proceed with the stipulated -\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dab\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bb0\u0bb5\u0bbf \u0b95\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) (The Hon. Ravi Karunanayake) So, allow it for the Opposition as well when we try to ensure that these are looked into. I mean, we do not lose any time on this.\n\nSo, I appreciate the precise Answer the Hon. Minister gave. That is why I thought I would add on a question, which would help you, Hon. Minister, to ensure that your portfolio is brought to more fruition in the future.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0d85\u0db1\u0dd4\u0dbb \u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dab\u0dcf\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dbd\u0d9a \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b85\u0ba9\u0bc1\u0bb0 \u0b95\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbe\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) (The Hon. Anura Karunathilaka) Hon. Ravi Karunanayake, thank you so much for your comments. We are revisiting the existing Master Plan of the Bandaranaike International Airport and are considering all possibilities to increase its capacity.\n\nAnd with regard to the second point you have raised, we have already started a round of discussions with several airlines to get more scheduled flights to Sri Lanka, exploiting the current situation in the Middle East.\n\nThank you so much."
  },
