    "chunk_text": "\u0d82\u0dda\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0dd2\u0db1\u0dba\u0dd2. \u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0d9a \u0dca\u0db7\u0dcf \u0dca\u0db7\u0dcf\u0db4\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dd2\u0dba (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b95\u0bc1\u0bb4\u0bc1\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bcd \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd \u0ba4\u0bb5\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bbe\u0bc8\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Chairperson of Committees) \u0db8\u0db1\u0dca \u0db1\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0dbb\u0d9c\u0db8 \u0d85\u0db4\u0db6\u0dca\u0dc3\u0dd2\u0d9c\u0dc4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0db4 \u0ddd\u0da2\u0dca\u200d\u0dba \u0d87\u0dab\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0dab\u0ddc. \u0d94\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0dab\u0ddc\u0da7 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc3\u0ddc\u0da9\u0dd2 12 \u0ddc\u0d9a \u0dca \u0d9a\u0dd0\u0db4\u0dca\u0dc3\u0dc0\u0ddc.\n\n[11.43 a.m.]\n\nBut, what we could say today is that, last year, with all those difficulties, Sri Lanka achieved a 5 per cent growth. Even with Cyclone \u201cDitwah\u201d that we had to face at the end of last year, Sri Lanka has achieved a strong growth trajectory, and now, we are moving forward to have a better year. Unfortunately, we have a shock coming from the global economy, even if there is no crisis as such in the country. The crisis was what Sri Lanka had in 2022, where we had twin deficits - a trade deficit and a fiscal deficit. Now, we have surpassed all those and have a positive trade balance and a fiscal balance. There is no crisis in Sri Lanka now. There is a war happening in the Middle East, and because of that, we have to face an economic shock, and that, the Government is quite ready to manage.\n\nIt is very unfortunate to see the Opposition trying to reduce the confidence of the investors in our country and create a fear among the entrepreneurs. But, I am pretty\n\n2361 2362\n\n\u0ddc\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0db8\u0db4\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0dc0\n\nsure that the Sri Lankan entrepreneurs and exporters are very resilient. Even within the past few weeks, they have been talking about issues that could impact our country. I am happy to say that even within the period of this war, that is, during the last two weeks, we did not see any drop in tea exports. Our exporters are resilient. They have figured out various ways of exporting their tea and there has been no problem at tea auctions so far, no reduction in prices, and the exporters are doing well."
  },
