    "chunk_text": "At the same time, we are seeing is a strong requirement when we go through BoI inquiries. Now, with the new Investment Promotion Act, we are going to make it extremely clear what kind of investments are promoted in Sri Lanka and what kind of tax holidays each of those categories would get. If we take the extension of tax holidays, they could be extended up to ten years based on the investment. Those things had not been cleared over the past decade. That is why investments did not come to Sri Lanka."
