    "chunk_text": "\u0db4\u0dca\u0ddc\u0db4\u0dc4\u0ddc\u0dab \u0d82\u0dda\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0dd2\u0db1\u0dba\u0dd2. \u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bcd \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Speaker) Next, the Hon. Rauff Hakeem. You have eight minutes to second the Adjournment Motion moved by the Hon. Mujibur Rahuman.\n\n[2.21 p.m.] \u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd3\u0dd2\u0db1\u0da5 \u0dbb\u0dc0\u0dd4\u0dc6\u0db4 \u0dc4\u0dc3\u0d9a\u0dd3\u0db8\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bb0\u0bc8\u0bbf \u0bb0\u0b8a\u0baa\u0bcd \u0bb9\u0b95\u0bc0\u0bae\u0bcd) (The Hon. Rauff Hakeem, Attorney-at-Law) Hon. Deputy Speaker, I second the Motion moved by the Hon. Mujibur Rahuman.\n\nHaving said that, Sir, I would like to say that this unfortunate war imposed on Iran has created global issues. One of the major issues is the oil shortage the entire world is facing.\n\nThis particular so-called asymmetrical war that has been imposed on Iran has been started along with a country that had been called an apartheid nation - Israel - for engaging in serious genecide against Palestinians. Has Iran caused genocide? Has Iran - you may not like the regime - established an apartheid State? No. But, an apartheid and a genocide State, together with the Americans, have bombarded Iran and killed several of its leaders, and this Government did not have the backbone to criticize that. So, now, what has happened? This is certainly a war of attrition, a war which is asymmetrical with it being fought between two disproportionate military powers. Of course, you cannot compare America\u2019s military power with that of Iran. Yet, a war which was said to be concluded within four to five days has now extended into four weeks and beyond; it might even go on for months because they are prepared. Now, the question is, who is at the threshold of pain, who can\n\n2405 2406\n\n\u0ddc\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0db8\u0db4\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0dc0\n\nwithstand pain? \u201cIf we get pain, you also had better suffer it\u201d has been the attitude of the Iranians. And, the entire Third World is applauding them. If you take a popular vote or a public opinion in Sri Lanka today, every community will stand with Iran, not with the Americans or the Israelis; hardly anybody would. You can see that on social media."
  },
